###################

Utility Keyboard Shortcuts

###################

-> Open terminal (alacritty + tmux)
Super + Return

-> App launcher (Rofi)
Super + d

-> Window switcher
Super + Ctrl + d

-> Show SSH sessions
Super + Shift + d

-> Power Menu
Super + Shift + e

-> Lock screen
Super + Ctrl + Shift + q

-> Reload Sxhkd (you need to do this after you modify sxhkdrc)
Super + Escape

-> Screen shot full monitor and save in Pictures folder
Print

-> Show screenshot menu
Super + Print

-> Bluetooth menu
Super + Shift + b

-> Volume up / down
Super + Page_Up / Super + Page_Down (or the volume keys)

-> Launch Firefox
Super + w

-> Launch Thunar
Super + n

-> Show this keybinding list
Super + F1

-> Move window to preselected screen location
Super + Shift + Ctrl + {u, i, o, j, k, l}





###################

Bspwm Keyboard Shortcuts

###################

-> Restart Bspwm
Super + Shift + r

-> Close / kill focused window
Super + q / Super + Shift + q

-> Switch between tiled and monocle layout
Super + m

-> Send newest marked node to newest preselected node
Super + y

-> Swap current and largest window
Super + g

-> Set window state {tiled, pseudo_tiled, floating, fullscreen}
Super + {t, Shift + t, s, f}

-> Set node flag {marked, locked, sticky, private}
Super + Ctrl + {m, x, y, z}

-> Change focus {west, south, north, east}
Super + {h, j, k, l}
It's like vim keys :)

-> Swap window {west, south, north, east}
Super + Shift + {h, j, k, l}

-> Focus {parent, brother, first, second}
Super + {p, b, comma, period}

-> Focus next / previous window
Super + c / Super + Shift + c

-> Focus previous / next desktop
Super + bracketleft / Super + bracketright

-> Switch to different desktop
Super + <number>

-> Send current node to different desktop
Super + Shift + <number>

-> Preselect direction {west, south, north, east}
Super + Ctrl + {h, j, k, l}

-> Preselect ratio
Super + Ctrl + <1-9>

-> Cancel preselection (node / desktop)
Super + Ctrl + space / Super + Ctrl + Shift + space

-> Expand a window {left, bottom, top, right}
Super + Alt + {h, j, k, l}

-> Contract a window {right, top, bottom, left}
Super + Alt + Shift + {h, j, k, l}

-> Move a floating window
Super + {Left, Down, Up, Right}

-> Focus the last node
Super + grave

-> Focus the last desktop
Super + Tab

-> Focus older node in focus history
Super + o

-> Focus newer node in focus history
Super + i
